TITLE:: CompressorGUI
summary:: a compressor in a window of its own
categories:: Libraries>Compressor
related:: Classes/Compressor, Classes/CompressorPanel

DESCRIPTION::
The link::Classes/CompressorPanel:: in the window every effect has (FxDeviceGUI,
from ParaEQ): 960 x 560, the hint at the left of one line along the bottom and
where the compressor runs at its right - code::bus 0 · 2 ch · on::, code::in master_localhost · on::,
code::driving orbit 1, before its fader · on::. What code::comp.gui:: opens.
Closing it stops the meters and the spectrum; the compressor itself is untouched.

code::
c = Compressor.new;
g = c.gui;          // or CompressorGUI(c)
g.panel.page = 1;
g.close;
::

